<view class="wrap">
  <view style="padding:12rpx 8rpx 24rpx; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-end">
    <view>
      <view class="h1">{{clinic_name || '选时段'}}</view>
      <view class="sub">选日期，再点一个还有号的时段</view>
    </view>
    <view class="tag gray" bindtap="changeClinic">换门店</view>
  </view>

  <scroll-view scroll-x class="days" enable-flex>
    <view wx:for="{{days}}" wx:key="date"
          class="day {{item.date === date ? 'on' : ''}}"
          data-d="{{item.date}}" bindtap="pickDay">
      <view class="d">{{item.md}}</view>
      <view class="w">周{{item.w}}</view>
      <view class="r {{item.remain ? '' : 'zero'}}">{{item.remain ? '剩' + item.remain : '无号'}}</view>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>

  <view wx:if="{{loadingSlots}}" class="card"><view class="empty">查号中…</view></view>

  <block wx:elif="{{slots.length}}">
    <view wx:for="{{slots}}" wx:key="roster_id"
          class="opt {{item.full ? 'full' : ''}}"
          data-i="{{index}}" bindtap="pickSlot">
      <view>
        <view class="t">{{item.start}} — {{item.end}}</view>
        <view class="s">{{item.dentist || '医生待定'}}</view>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{item.full}}" class="tag gray">已约满</view>
      <view wx:else class="tag green">剩 {{item.left}} 位</view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <view wx:else class="card">
    <view class="empty">这一天这家店没有放过号，换一天看看</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="muted" style="font-size:24rpx">
      号是实时占的：你看到「剩 N 位」的时候别人也可能同时在点，
      提交时如果刚好被抢完，会提示你换一个。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
